# /etc/potyro/sync-gate.env — the gate in front of the sync relay (packages/sync-gate, docs/16 "The
# gate in front of the relay"). Optional, and nothing in it is secret: without it the gate runs on
# its defaults. After editing it: `sudo RECREATE=1 deploy/containers.sh gate`.
# Leave out a line to get its default: docker reads `NAME=` as an empty value, not as unset.
# HOST, PORT, SYNC_UPSTREAM and SYNC_DISK_PATH are on the gate's `docker run` line in
# deploy/containers.sh. Every variable and its default is also at the top of packages/sync-gate/src/server.ts.

# The two to size to the server before a launch. Bytes sent TOWARDS the relay are what its disk grows
# by; nothing the relay is sent is ever freed (docs/16 "What the relay holds").
# From everyone together, a calendar day (UTC). Default 10737418240 (10 GiB). Past it sync is closed
# until midnight UTC; apps keep working on each device and catch up after.
# SYNC_BYTES_DAY=
# Sync is closed while the relay's disk has less than this free. Default 2147483648 (2 GiB).
# SYNC_MIN_FREE_BYTES=

# Per address (an IPv6 address counts as its /64), with their defaults:
# SYNC_CONNECTIONS_PER_ADDRESS=  64          at once; the next is refused (429)
# SYNC_CONNECTS_PER_SECOND=      10          new connections a second (burst SYNC_CONNECT_BURST, 300); refused past it (429)
# SYNC_BYTES_PER_SECOND=         1048576     towards the relay (burst SYNC_BYTE_BURST, 8388608); slowed past it, not closed
# SYNC_FRAMES_PER_SECOND=        1000        (burst SYNC_FRAME_BURST, 20000); slowed past it, not closed
# SYNC_BYTES_PER_ADDRESS_DAY=    536870912   towards the relay a calendar day (UTC); closed (4021) and refused (429) past it.
#                                            A twentieth of SYNC_BYTES_DAY: lower the two together (docs/16)
# SYNC_BYTES_PER_NET_DAY=        1073741824  the same, for all the /64s of one IPv6 /48 together

# The gate itself:
# SYNC_MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES=        8388608     one message; longer closes the connection (1009)
# SYNC_MAX_CONNECTIONS=          5000        at once, from everyone
# SYNC_MAX_ADDRESSES=            100000      addresses counted at once
# TRUST_PROXY=                   caddy       whose X-Forwarded-For to believe: caddy (the last entry) or none.
#                                            With caddy the gate starts only on a loopback HOST (it is, on the
#                                            run line); TRUST_PROXY_OFF_LOOPBACK=1 overrides, for a port closed some other way

# Which websites' pages may connect. Default: any. Switch this on once the Android app has synced
# through the gate (it is the list the rooms relay runs with; docs/16 says what it stops and why it
# is not the default). A browser from any other site then gets 403.
# SYNC_ORIGINS=https://potyro.app,https://localhost,capacitor://localhost
